  "title": "Steel Dynamics Announces Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call and Webcast",
  "summary": "FORT WAYNE, Ind., July 9, 2026 /PRNewswire/ — Steel Dynamics, Inc. (NASDAQ/GS: STLD), one of the largest domestic steel producers and metals recyclers in North America, today announced it intends to release second quarter 2026 financial results after market close on Monday, July 20, 2026. The teleconference is scheduled to begin at 11:00 a.m. Eastern […]",
